# Keyboard CSS Layout Rule

- The keyboard must never stretch to fill the entire width of the page.
- `.keyboardContainer` uses `display: inline-flex` and is centered with `margin: 0 auto`.
- All key sizing is handled by `aspect-ratio` and `em` units, never `px` or `!important`.
- The main keyboard UI is in [src/App.tsx](mdc:src/App.tsx).
- All keyboard-related styles are in [src/App.css](mdc:src/App.css).
- This rule ensures the keyboard remains visually correct, centered, and responsive at all window sizes.
